<hr />
<p>Today is a special day my friends. Exactly 365 days ago (give or take a few hours) I first joined this website. 365 days of pianos, VHS tapes, giant squids, and posters. I just want to thank everyone on this site who has ever interacted with me in any way, positively or negatively, for making this website so near and dear to me.</p>
<p>Big thanks to my fantastic critters:</p>
<ul>
<li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/athosnetwork" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5012224); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5012224&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1596430530" alt="AthosNetwork" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5012224)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/athosnetwork" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5012224); return false;">AthosNetwork</a></span> for wading through my awful first two drafts and sticking with me.</li>
<li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/t-rutherford" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4620432); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4620432&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1596430530" alt="T Rutherford" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4620432)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/t-rutherford" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4620432); return false;">T Rutherford</a></span> for his fantastic critique on the end log.</li>
<li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rattles" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4377609); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4377609&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1596430530" alt="rattles" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4377609)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rattles" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4377609); return false;">rattles</a></span> for his great critique on the formatting and description.</li>
<li>My personal friend Chrisse who helped me develop this idea in the first place.</li>
<li>and my honorary critter <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/themightymcb" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4483018); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4483018&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1596430530" alt="TheMightyMcB" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4483018)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/themightymcb" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4483018); return false;">TheMightyMcB</a></span>.</li>
</ul>
<p>Thank you all for putting up with me for so long. Here's to another 365 days of dumb puns and weird ideas.</p>
